 "id": "sb-amrev-franklin-son",
 "short": true,
 "film": true,
 "photosFrom": "sb-american-revolution",
 "title": "Do You Know Benjamin Franklin's Son Fought for the King? #shorts",
 "intro": {
  "mood": "tension",
  "beats": [
   {
    "say": "Do you know Benjamin Franklin's own son fought against the American Revolution?",
    "scene": {
     "shot": "faces",
     "names": [
      [
       "BENJAMIN FRANKLIN",
       "becoming a rebel"
      ],
      [
       "WILLIAM FRANKLIN",
       "the King's man"
      ]
     ],
     "nameAt": 0.4,
     "push": 0.06,
     "people": [
      {
       "preset": "franklin",
       "x": 0.3
      },
      {
       "preset": "governor",
       "x": 0.7
      }
     ]
    },
    "do": [],
    "cam": {
     "lon": -74.6,
     "lat": 40.4,
     "scale": 5200
    }
   },
   {
    "say": "He was the King's governor of New Jersey. His father helped him get the job.",
    "scene": {
     "shot": "photo",
     "img": "wfranklin",
     "move": "in",
     "caption": "William Franklin, Royal Governor of New Jersey",
     "focus": [
      0.5,
      0.3
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "talk": [
     {
      "who": "FRA",
      "text": "Resign, William. Join us."
     },
     {
      "who": "WIL",
      "text": "I serve the King."
     }
    ],
    "bg": {
     "shot": "set",
     "time": "day",
     "parts": [
      {
       "type": "room",
       "flag": "uk",
       "window": 0.7,
       "night": false,
       "depth": 0.3
      },
      {
       "type": "table",
       "lamp": 0.6,
       "candles": 2,
       "papers": 6,
       "w": 900,
       "depth": 0.6
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "say": "In 1776, the rebels arrested him. Later they kept him alone in a cell, for eight months.",
    "do": [
     {
      "card": {
       "kind": "big",
       "text": "8 MONTHS ALONE",
       "dur": 2.4
      },
      "on": "alone"
     }
    ],
    "scene": {
     "shot": "set",
     "time": "night",
     "parts": [
      {
       "type": "room",
       "flag": null,
       "window": null,
       "night": true,
       "depth": 0.3,
       "wall": "#16120e"
      },
      {
       "type": "people",
       "list": [
        {
         "x": 0.5,
         "facing": 1,
         "h": 0.8,
         "photo": "wfranklin"
        }
       ],
       "lx": 0.4,
       "ly": 0.6,
       "depth": 0.85
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "say": "His wife was dying. He asked to see her. The answer was no.",
    "scene": {
     "shot": "set",
     "time": "night",
     "parts": [
      {
       "type": "room",
       "flag": null,
       "window": 0.5,
       "night": true,
       "depth": 0.3,
       "wall": "#0f0d0c"
      },
      {
       "type": "table",
       "lamp": 0.4,
       "candles": 1,
       "papers": 1,
       "w": 900,
       "depth": 0.6
      }
     ],
     "fx": [
      "dust"
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "say": "After the war, they met only once. Benjamin never forgave him.",
    "scene": {
     "shot": "photo",
     "img": "bfranklin",
     "move": "right",
     "caption": "Benjamin Franklin",
     "focus": [
      0.5,
      0.3
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "say": "In his will, he left William some land in Nova Scotia. And this line.",
    "scene": {
     "shot": "doc",
     "kind": "letter",
     "header": "The will of Benjamin Franklin, 1788",
     "lines": [
      "\"To my son, William Franklin,",
      "late Governor of the Jerseys...\""
     ],
     "sign": "B. Franklin"
    }
   },
   {
    "say": "The part he acted against me in the late war, will account for my leaving him no more of an estate he endeavoured to deprive me of.",
    "scene": {
     "shot": "doc",
     "kind": "letter",
     "header": "The will of Benjamin Franklin, 1788",
     "lines": [
      "\"The part he acted against me",
      "in the late war ... will account",
      "for my leaving him no more of an",
      "estate he endeavoured to deprive me of.\""
     ],
     "sign": "B. Franklin",
     "hl": [
      0
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "say": "Father against son. That was the American Revolution.",
    "scene": {
     "shot": "faces",
     "names": [
      [
       "BENJAMIN FRANKLIN",
       "becoming a rebel"
      ],
      [
       "WILLIAM FRANKLIN",
       "the King's man"
      ]
     ],
